# The Dockerfiles copy only package manifests, apps/ and packages/. Without this
# those COPY steps also pull in host build output, including node_modules built
# for another platform and .next, and the context carries local secrets.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
_plans
_scratch
docs
tests
sample-data
